"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3n2FIVhxAjG6fjju4wdzXw","review_id":"AxcMnh4A7wuCyKtcvb_fXg","date":"2016-12-21T18:55:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.940343976020813,"text_excerpt":"I was in the area, and in the mood for coffee, so The Bean Gallery was a natural pick. Parking was easy on this particular day- plenty of street parking, and there was a good crowd in the place. I like the atmosphere here and there are plenty of tables and sofas where people can spread out and do work. WiFi is free with a password. The man working was really nice. I got my usual large iced coffee and I found the coffee here to be good, without being too strong. While I would say the coffee should definitely be sipped, I didn't find it overwhelming at all. There are some tables and chairs, if you want to sit outside on a nice day and they also serve an assortment of sandwiches if you want ..."},{"business_id":"3n2FIVhxAjG6fjju4wdzXw","review_id":"XHZFPFQqLkfYYECSWsrb_A","date":"2014-11-04T05:51:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9324302077293396,"text_excerpt":"I really like this place, i've found myself in here a bit more lately than usual. Trying to get these last bike rides in while the weather permits has had me up earlier than usual these past mornings and stopping in here to kick off the day has been the move. I salute this coffee shop solely on their hours. I mean, opening at the crack of dawn and closing at midnight?! Talk about being there for you. The inside is really cozy, homey feel. Some well placed tables here n there, nice little seating area outside for you smokers and birdwatchers, it's some nice digs. Nice, clean bathrooms, bike parking just outside, no private lot but there's ample street parking so there shouldn't be much of ..."},{"business_id":"3n2FIVhxAjG6fjju4wdzXw","review_id":"Dmrf1thzUlsd7l0KfoWx3A","date":"2020-07-18T02:13:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9324220418930054,"text_excerpt":"This has to be one of my new favorite places to get a good sandwich & some coffee! All of their sandwiches sounded so good, it was hard for me to pick which one I wanted to order! If you like cafés with quality food, definitely come to The Bean Gallery. They have such a cute set-up inside with board games and also a nice outside area--all socially distances of course. Will for sure be coming here again!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3n2FIVhxAjG6fjju4wdzXw","photo_id":"jvPNIj7BSw-UBIZCYbKJug","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/jvPNIj7BSw-UBIZCYbKJug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8876198530197144},{"business_id":"3n2FIVhxAjG6fjju4wdzXw","photo_id":"GJOfl14srLfKqZdGbfiZOg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GJOfl14srLfKqZdGbfiZOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8452692031860352},{"business_id":"3n2FIVhxAjG6fjju4wdzXw","photo_id":"LBKdDZDZPeb1Z95Y9kX85Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LBKdDZDZPeb1Z95Y9kX85Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.841586172580719},{"business_id":"3n2FIVhxAjG6fjju4wdzXw","photo_id":"mNCIu25IEc7E_y7zHKkjUw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mNCIu25IEc7E_y7zHKkjUw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8174996376037598},{"business_id"